{"operations":[{"content":"The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute. [[cite:obs-7eddf4089806c88c18a5cbe56b49e9f9acb5c47e \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n\nThe retention rule is that records must be kept according to the schedule defined in the statute, which determines how long the records are kept. [[cite:obs-7eddf4089806c88c18a5cbe56b49e9f9acb5c47e \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]","expected_sha256":"5949a6d31a9d0e999d58167ddda45b42923ca0e84641ae174b47666e7eab4440","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added explicit statement of the statute's retention rule and duration of record keeping, each supported by the exact source quote from obs-7eddf4089806c88c18a5cbe56b49e9f9acb5c47e, as required."}